# Base URL for the API. Leave unset for local dev — Vite's dev proxy (vite.config.js) forwards
# "/api" to the local server, so client and server share an origin and no CORS/cookie handling
# is needed.
#
# In production, client and server are on different domains (e.g. this app on Vercel, the API on
# Render) — set this to the deployed server's absolute URL, including the "/api" prefix, e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://your-app.onrender.com/api"
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
